# Config lookup autocomplete (`app-config-lookup-autocomplete`)

Use for any field backed by an **admin system config group** (same codes as `getValues` / Constants management).

## Inject the code (required)

```html
<app-config-lookup-autocomplete
  formControlName="someLookup"
  [configCode]="SYSTEM_CONFIG_CODES.EDUCATIONAL_INSTITUTION"
/>
```

The **`configCode` input is not institution-specific** — it selects which catalog this control uses:

| Code (example) | Used for |
|----------------|----------|
| `SYSTEM_CONFIG_CODES.EDUCATIONAL_INSTITUTION` | Academic institution on education tab |
| `SYSTEM_CONFIG_CODES.FIELD_OF_STUDY` | Could replace static select + allow custom values |
| Any other `getValues(code)` group | Same component, different catalog |

Codes live in `system-config-codes.ts`; seed rows in `mock-admin-system.state.ts` and list them in admin Constants management.

## Value shape

```ts
{ id?: string | number; label_en: string; label_ar: string }
```

- **Selected from dropdown** → `id` set, both labels from row.
- **Typed without selecting** → no `id`; active locale label filled (create on save).

Validator: `configLookupRequired()` from `config-lookup.validators.ts`.

## API

- **Search:** `AdminSystemApiService.searchConfigValues(configCode, query)` → `GET /api/v2/admin/system-config/values/{code}/search?q=…`
- **Full list:** `getValues(configCode)` (unchanged)
- **Ensure (find-or-create):** `AdminSystemApiService.ensureConfigValue(configCode, lookup)` on free-text commit and on form save when `id` is missing (mock: `POST …/values/{code}/ensure`)

## Linked sub-catalog (main + sub pair)

When a main catalog has dependent sub-values, register the pair in `system-config-sub-codes.util.ts` (`MAIN_TO_SUB_CONFIG_CODE`). Then wire the form with **two inputs only**:

```html
<app-config-lookup-autocomplete
  formControlName="mainLookup"
  [configCode]="SYSTEM_CONFIG_CODES.SOME_MAIN"
  [subControl]="form.controls.subLookup"
  [subFieldLabel]="labels().subLabel"
/>
```

- Sub catalog code is **resolved automatically** from `MAIN_TO_SUB_CONFIG_CODE[configCode]`.
- Override with `[subConfigCode]` only when needed.
- On the main row, enable **Linked sub-menu** in Constants → Main (sets `subReasonDropdown` on the API row).
- Sub values are managed under Constants → Sub, filtered by parent main value.

## Do not

- Hard-code `EDUC_INST` inside the component — only the **parent** passes `[configCode]`.
- Use `SuggestionsApiService.getSuggestion` for catalog-backed bilingual rows (that API is for plain string fragments, e.g. sub-specialty).
